  "description": "Typed decision model adapter for Trax.Effect. Adds AddNimbleDecider(...), for Bespoke Labs' open-weights Nimble on a Nimble server you run, and AddSystemOneDecider(...) to the AddEffects builder, which answer a train's Decide, Switch, Gate and Scale questions through the System One request format that Jev and Nimble's server accept, with retries, a pinned model version, named registrations for running several models side by side, and every answer checked before a train acts on it.",
